# steps/free-names.md (class A): the caller's int k meets a size_t local in one expression -- a mix, refused at the
# value as the same int declared in peek is.  Before M2 the C compiler decided it.
fn: peek () size_t
    size_t: j 3U
    return: k + j
fn: m () size_t
    int: k 5
    return: peek()

sendMessage: exit(exit_code: 7; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
